From 42c6efb714d92b48b964dc7202a5028a069025bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herlon Aguiar <3419441+mxfp0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 11:23:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Restore native FP4 cache kernels on SM121

Keep the official V4.1 model and scheduler. Use the qualified interleaved MXFP8/NVFP4 writers and sparse MLA/indexer arithmetic with native metadata and bounded scratch. Return raw attention to the official output projection. Cover normal forward, bounded replay and DSpark context cache writes.
